Description:
[b]Summary:[/b]
<br />
<br />"Radical Emotes" remakes the Vanilla emotes (unused and not) to give people's playthroughs some zest and quite possibly gormlessness. The emote menu icons have also been updated for consistency.
<br />
<br />[b]Installation:[/b]
<br />
<br />[list=1]
<br />[*]Install [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/2400]SMAPI[/url];
<br />[*]Install ﻿[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/1915]Content Patcher[/url];
<br />[*]﻿As usual, download the main .zip file of this mod and extract it within Stardew's mod folder.
<br />[/list]
<br />[b]Mods featured in the screenshots:
<br />[/b]
<br />[list]
<br />[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/5450]Seasonal Outfits - Slightly Cuter Aesthetic[/url]﻿ - The unfathomable drip of the townsfolk;
<br />[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/21085]Starblue Valley Unofficial[/url] - Wacky terrain colors;
<br />[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/20972]Simple Foliage - Unofficial Update for 1.6[/url] - Cool-looking tree sprites;
<br />[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/37662]radsilver's Hairy Yaks[/url] - Yak, partially made by yours truly;
<br />[*]﻿[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/22954](CP) Nano's Decorative Tree Furniture[/url] - The bush by Raymond's farmhouse;
<br />[*]﻿[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/36273]HxW Outdoor Flower Furniture[/url] - The flower by Raymond's farmhouse;
<br />[*]﻿[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/1993]Elle's Seasonal Buildings[/url] - Screw it, here's the whole farmhouse;
<br />[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/17246]Subtler Glasses (for Fashion Sense)[/url]﻿ - Raymond's glasses;
<br />[*]﻿[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/10102]FS - Cozy Scarves[/url]﻿ - Raymond's scarf;
<br />[*][url=http://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/32523](FS) Adventurer's Armor and Clothing[/url] - Raymond's hat;
<br />[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/13393]FS - SB's Oversized Sleeves[/url] - Raymond's sleeves. I know at least one of you was wondering about that.﻿
<br />﻿﻿[/list]
